### health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/health

### overview
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/overview

### recovery summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/recovery

### create snapshot
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/recovery/snapshots
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "volume": "volume1",
  "name": "http-client-snapshot"
}

### restore file
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/recovery/restore-file
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "snapshotId": "snap-system-001",
  "sourcePath": "/srv/nas/team/roadmap.xlsx",
  "targetPath": "/srv/nas/restore/roadmap.xlsx"
}

### network summary
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/network

### apply network profile
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/network/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nicId": "eth0",
  "mode": "static",
  "ipv4": "192.168.10.40",
  "mask": "255.255.255.0",
  "gateway": "192.168.10.1",
  "dns": ["223.5.5.5", "1.1.1.1"],
  "simulateFailure": false
}

### create vm
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/vms
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "http-client-vm",
  "cpu": 2,
  "memoryGb": 4,
  "diskGb": 50,
  "networkId": "eth0",
  "template": "Ubuntu 24.04 Base"
}

### power vm
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/vms/vm-demo-001/power
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "start"
}

### tasks
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/tasks
